The legal text
==============

The text of the statutes in this repository is reproduced from e-Laws (https://www.ontario.ca/laws), published by the
King's Printer for Ontario, under the King's Printer's "Policy on copyright on legal materials"
(https://www.ontario.ca/page/copyright-information):

  "The King's Printer for Ontario holds copyright in Ontario statutes, regulations and judicial decisions. The King's
  Printer permits any person to reproduce the text and images contained in the statutes, regulations and judicial
  decisions without seeking permission and without charge. The legal materials must be reproduced accurately, and
  Crown copyright in the legal materials must be acknowledged in the following form: (c) King's Printer for Ontario,
  20__."

  "Reproductions of statutes and regulations that are not official copies under that Act [the Legislation Act, 2006]
  must state that they are not official versions."

(c) King's Printer for Ontario, 1990 (Highway Traffic Act, R.S.O. 1990, c. H.8); 2000 (Employment Standards Act, 2000,
S.O. 2000, c. 41); 2006 (Residential Tenancies Act, 2006, S.O. 2006, c. 17; Legislation Act, 2006, S.O. 2006, c. 21,
Sched. F).

THIS REPRODUCTION IS NOT AN OFFICIAL VERSION. It is not an official copy under section 35 of the Legislation Act, 2006,
and it is not produced in affiliation with, or with the endorsement of, the Government of Ontario.

